.SH NAME
\fBxnvme-test-dual-be-idfy-cmp \fP- Issue an Identify Controller command through each of the two backends
\fBsharing the same NVMe controller, then byte-compare the responses.
\fBA mismatch indicates dual-backend operation returned inconsistent data.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.fam C
\fBxnvme-test-dual-be\fP \fIidfy-cmp\fP <uri> [<args>]
.fam T
.fi
